Vnum            9408
Name            裂縫前台~
Description
斷裂岩層在此向內凹出一片避風的平台，岩壁邊緣隱約可見向下延伸的窄口裂縫。地面散著乾掉的草繩與碎裂木樁，像曾有人試圖封住下方的入口。
~
SectorType      SECT_HILLS

#Exit
Direction       WEST
ExitVnum        9404
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       SOUTH
ExitVnum        9409
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        9410
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Keyword
Keyword         裂縫~
Description
裂縫邊緣帶著潮氣，底下不時送上冷風，像有一條更深的石道正等著人下去。
~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         裂縫~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         下方~
End

